WHY YOUR TOKEN BILL DOUBLED WHEN USAGE GREW 30%
A reader question we get a lot, so here is the answer. Token volume is not linear in "usage." A new customer onboarding triggers a backfill over their history; a new data source adds context to every subsequent call; a longer system prompt multiplies across all traffic. Three teams this month reported bills roughly 2x their model because of one-time backfills they had not separated from steady state in the forecast. Separate them. https://latentdispatch.ai/p/token-volume-surprise

